&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/ihG1LmFxsUuC" style="color: #fff; background: #e74c3c; padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); display: inline-block;"&gt;前往查看详情&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
